# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own key (free at weatherapi.com).
#
# IMPORTANT: This is a frontend-only app, so the key WILL be bundled into
# the public JS and visible in any user's DevTools. Use the WeatherAPI free
# tier (1M calls/month) which is rate-limited per-key — fine for personal
# / portfolio projects. For a high-traffic production deployment, proxy
# WeatherAPI through your own backend instead.
VITE_WEATHER_API_KEY=your_weatherapi_key_here
